21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3436882842,"text":"君たちならきっとやってくれると思っていた。","nextNodeIds":[750080109]},{"nodeId":750080109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":3449693258,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[750080110]},{"nodeId":750080110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2098182834,"text":"ほら、この円盤みたいなやつだ！","nextNodeIds":[750080111]},{"nodeId":750080111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":786116402,"text":"ああ…「通牒の金盤」だ！伝説の「通牒の金盤」は実在していたのか…！素晴らしい、研究資料に加筆しておかなければ。","nextNodeIds":[750080112]},{"nodeId":750080112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":855981058,"text":"「通牒の金盤」っていうのか？","nextNodeIds":[750080113]},{"nodeId":750080113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3220496122,"text":"あ、ああ。失礼、とても興奮してしまって…これは「盗炎の賢者」が手ずから扱ったものだと言われている…","nextNodeIds":[750080114]},{"nodeId":750080114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":23426514,"text":"正直なところ…一瞬だけ、持ち帰って家宝に…と思ってしまった…","nextNodeIds":[750080115]},{"nodeId":750080115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":798663418,"text":"#ダメだぞ！これで{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}を助けないといけないんだから！","nextNodeIds":[750080116]},{"nodeId":750080116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2109689754,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[750080117]},{"nodeId":750080117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2113903042,"text":"ああ、分かっている…さて、俺が持っているのは、この一枚の手がかりだけだった。もう一枚の在り処については、さっぱりだ…","nextNodeIds":[750080118]},{"nodeId":750080118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3748710130,"text":"オシカ·ナタ…","nextNodeIds":[750080119]},{"nodeId":750080119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3218065106,"text":"#ん？{NICKNAME}、今「オシカ·ナタ」と言ったか…？","nextNodeIds":[750080120]},{"nodeId":750080120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":996306602,"text":"（石碑に触れた時に見えたことを伝えた…）","nextNodeIds":[750080121]},{"nodeId":750080121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3111607298,"text":"なるほど。まさかオシカ·ナタとはな…オシカ·ナタは花翼の集の北、海を隔てたところにある古の都市の遺跡だ…","nextNodeIds":[750080122]},{"nodeId":750080122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2976738690,"text":"オシカ·ナタとなると…申し訳ないが、力になれそうにない。あそこは部族はもとより、龍の遺物研究会の研究員ですら、立ち入りが禁止されているんだ…","nextNodeIds":[750080123]},{"nodeId":750080123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3384160938,"text":"何年も前、龍の遺物研究会の研究員が依頼を受けてオシカ·ナタへ調査しに行った。だが、海に沈んだ石のように、消息を断ってしまった…","nextNodeIds":[750080124]},{"nodeId":750080124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3513177218,"text":"それ以来、研究会ではオシカ·ナタに一切手を出さなくなった。","nextNodeIds":[750080125]},{"nodeId":750080125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2118756754,"text":"気にするなって。それだけ情報があれば十分だ！","nextNodeIds":[750080126]},{"nodeId":750080126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2919552378,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[750080127]},{"nodeId":750080127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":233817826,"text":"ああ…改めて礼を言わせてくれ。「通牒の金盤」をこの目で見られて本当に嬉しいんだ。早く帰ってしっかり記録しておかないと…","nextNodeIds":[750080128]},{"nodeId":750080128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3080871002,"text":"#本当にありがとう、{NICKNAME}とパイモン。君たちの旅がうまくいくことを願っている。","nextNodeIds":[750080129]},{"nodeId":750080129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2848392706,"text":"#それから、{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}、君の「焔の主の祝福」の印が取れますよう