,"textMapHash":1853995666,"text":"ああ…二枚の…「通牒の金盤」！伝説の「通牒の金盤」は実在していたのか…！素晴らしい、研究資料に加筆しておかなければ。","nextNodeIds":[750080212]},{"nodeId":750080212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":550650530,"text":"「通牒の金盤」っていうのか？","nextNodeIds":[750080213]},{"nodeId":750080213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1634730354,"text":"あ、ああ。失礼、とても興奮してしまって…これは「盗炎の賢者」と初代炎神、伝説のお二人が手ずから扱ったものだと言われている…","nextNodeIds":[750080214]},{"nodeId":750080214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":355840002,"text":"正直なところ…一瞬だけ、持ち帰って家宝に…と思ってしまった…","nextNodeIds":[750080215]},{"nodeId":750080215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3348424786,"text":"#ダメだぞ！これで{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}を助けないといけないんだから！","nextNodeIds":[750080216]},{"nodeId":750080216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1190492914,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[750080217]},{"nodeId":750080217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2486931050,"text":"ああ、分かっている…次の目的地はトゥラン大火山だな。","nextNodeIds":[750080218]},{"nodeId":750080218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":668054978,"text":"伝説によると、シュバランケは炎神になる前、光と熱を司る焔の主と戦ったという…","nextNodeIds":[750080219]},{"nodeId":750080219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":963850434,"text":"その戦いで勝ち残った勇者シュバランケが、初代炎神となったのだ。","nextNodeIds":[750080220]},{"nodeId":750080220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3574283706,"text":"しかし、火山の中に何があるのかは誰も知らない。休眠中の古龍が隠れているという説もあれば、すでにシュバランケの炎で焼き尽くされて、がらんどうになってしまったという説もある。","nextNodeIds":[750080221]},{"nodeId":750080221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1759616530,"text":"まあ、どちらも物語を語る者の憶測にすぎないと俺は思っているが…","nextNodeIds":[750080222]},{"nodeId":750080222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1760037778,"text":"君たちについて行きたいが…この身体じゃ到底無理そうだ…","nextNodeIds":[750080223]},{"nodeId":750080223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3418071962,"text":"気にするなって。それだけ情報があれば十分だ！","nextNodeIds":[750080224]},{"nodeId":750080224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":953177066,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[750080225]},{"nodeId":750080225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2523916946,"text":"ああ…改めて礼を言わせてくれ。「通牒の金盤」をこの目で見られて本当に嬉しいんだ。早く帰ってしっかり記録しておかないと…","nextNodeIds":[750080226]},{"nodeId":750080226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1495863986,"text":"#本当にありがとう、{NICKNAME}とパイモン。君たちの旅がうまくいくことを願っている。","nextNodeIds":[750080227]},{"nodeId":750080227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1532946418,"text":"#それから、{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}、君の「焔の主の祝福」の印が取れますように。","nextNodeIds":[750080228]},{"nodeId":750080228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2035417578,"text":"じゃあね！","nextNodeIds":[750080229]},{"nodeId":750080229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3054664434,"text":"ああ…旅の終点…すべての魂が帰る場所で、必ず再会できるだろう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750080207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1593301866,"text":"楽勝だったよ。","nextNodeIds":[750080208]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7500801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7500802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7515106,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEAL